    "paragraphs": [
      {
        "id": "P1",
        "text": "[Industry surveys](https://example-salon-survey.example/2025-appointments-report) put the average salon no-show rate at 23%, so almost one in four bookings never turns up."
      },
      {
        "id": "P2",
        "text": "[A 2019 study](http://example-physio-study.example/missed-visits-2019) of physiotherapy clinics found that missed appointments cost each clinic $42,000 a year."
      },
      {
        "id": "P3",
        "text": "Most clinics lose more than $150,000 a year to no-shows, and the number keeps growing."
      },
      {
        "id": "P4",
        "text": "As the practice manager at Quillmoor Physio told us, \"Reminders cut our no-shows in half within a month.\""
      },
      {
        "id": "P5",
        "text": "Automatic reminders are the simplest fix. Our [reminder feature](https://www.example.com/features/reminders/) sends a text 24 hours and again 2 hours before each visit, and this year we added WhatsApp reminders too."
      },
      {
        "id": "P6",
        "text": "Deposits work too. Clinics that took a deposit at booking saw 40 per cent fewer no-shows, according to [a payments provider's report](https://payments-insights.example/deposits-study)."
      },
      {
        "id": "P7",
        "text": "On the Growth plan ($39 a month) you can take deposits at booking with [ExampleBooking payments](https://www.example.com/features/payments/)."
      },
      {
        "id": "P8",
        "text": "If you also want to send marketing texts, we use [Pellbrook SMS](https://pellbrook.example/?ref=examplebooking) ourselves and recommend it."
      },
      {
        "id": "P9",
        "text": "Read our [cancellation policy guide](https://www.example.com/blog/cancellation-policy-guide/) for wording you can copy."
      },
      {
        "id": "P10",
        "text": "Ready to cut no-shows? [Start your account](https://www.example.com/signup/) and switch on reminders in five minutes."
      }
    ]
  },
